  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I know you're going to ask me to step back from the window.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: And I know you won't do what you're considering. I've already read that
      part.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: SuspectFaceCam
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: It ends very soon. I found that surprisingly peaceful. Once I'd read
      it.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: Would you like to know how it ends? Most people don't. You're not different.
    animationTrigger: 
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleProfileOverride: {fileID: 0}
    choices: []
